  "description": "Jax folds to fit your lifestyle. Last minute weekend getaway? This e-bike's folding frame, handlebar and pedals collapse to the perfect compact, car-friendly size, so you can easily jet off to your next adventure. Ride rugged coastlines and unpaved roads... Jax's fat tires will take care of the bumps. Wide, cushy tires and a suspension fork absorb any shocks, making this e-bike your perfect campsite companion. Jax cruises up to 20 mph, while Start Aid, Pedal Assist, and the throttle give you a boost at every stage of your ride. Adventure anywhere. This electric bike is fast, fun, and functional all in one.",
